SUMMARY:Discovery Hub 2026 - Day 1
DESCRIPTION:Interactive science and creative activities and workshops on 
 the theme Create and Celebrate. Schools activities target KS2 and KS3 st
 udents\, with a general public drop-in.\nPrice: Free\nhttps://bloomsbury
